VII. CONCLUSIONS
In this work, we develop an online state-time trajectory planner that is suitable for planning in highly dynamic environments. Experiments on the simulation environment and benchmark datasets significantly demonstrate the advantages of our proposed planner. The integration of path initialization by the front end and the Timed-ESDF in the back end make a great contribution to the high success rate of the state-time planning. The current planner does not consider holonomic constraints, which will be the focus of our future work.
